    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "*   **R-003 (WebSocket Security)**: Must be solved before the first dogfood. *   **R-006 (Worktree Safety)**: Basic worktree isolation is required to prevent accidental data loss. *   **R-002 (Supply-Chain)**: Basic patch review governance must be in place.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
